# Kernel patch order for the 17.1 port.
# Base: clienthax/android_kernel_huawei_AGS-W09 (android-7.x) at b4cffd28, with
#       clienthax/qcom_opensource_wlan_prima (android-7.x) at eed7cd6 in vendor/qcom/opensource/wlan/prima.
# 0. copy binder/{*.c,*.h,Kconfig,Makefile} to drivers/staging/android/ and
#    binder/uapi/binder.h to drivers/staging/android/uapi/   (15.1 fix 3)
# Steps 0-5 reproduce the 15.1 v2 kernel source exactly (verified 2026-11-03 against the tree
# that built v15.1-20261102); 6-8 are the Android 10 additions.
oreo-camera-v2.patch            # 1. camera UAPI + camera debug off (15.1 fix 33)
lcdkit-cabc-restore.patch       # 2. panel CABC (15.1 fix 50)
backend-dai-name-table.patch    # 3. audio routing (15.1 fix 57)
panel-node-name.patch           # 4. DT panel node named as the eng aboot passes it (mdss_mdp.panel=)
prima-mdns-filter-oops.patch    # 5. patch -p1 from the kernel root (touches the nested prima repo)
ambient-caps-3.18.patch         # 6. upstream v4.3 backport; REQUIRED on Android 10 (15.1 fix 4)
dcheck-root-err-ptr.patch       # 7. replaces the 15.1 ramdisk default.prop workaround (fix 7)
defconfig-android10.patch       # 8. IKCONFIG_PROC on, DEVMEM/USELIB off
# Build: scripts/build-kernel.sh <lineage tree> <out dir>
